    "body": "**Step 1 (#675) is reviewed clean and labelled `merge-ready`.**\n\n**Step 2 carries the review's non-blocking notes:**\n- refuse `small` unless the role is Inner;\n- pin that a one-point cut without `small` is refused;\n- treat an Open parent as Malformed;\n- **recompute enclosure from the geometry** rather than trusting the CL's `PARENT`, refusing a disagreement by name.\n\n**Step 2 itself:** build `PlasmaProgram` from #676's `Toolpath::plasma` / `TorchSpan` records, block the post on a refusal, judge #676's decision item 12 (an outer slot narrower than the kerf that the offset bridges), and update #674's machine-check `notes`. It starts once #674, #676 and #675 are on main.",
